# ESP-IDF / Component Manager (all firmware projects and CMake presets)
**/build/
**/build-*/
**/build.invalid-*/
**/cmake-build-*/
**/CMakeUserPresets.json
**/managed_components/
**/sdkconfig
**/sdkconfig.old
**/sdkconfig.old.*

# Out-of-tree CMake / Ninja / compiler products
**/CMakeCache.txt
**/CMakeFiles/
**/cmake_install.cmake
**/compile_commands.json
**/build.ninja
**/.ninja_deps
**/.ninja_log
**/Testing/Temporary/
*.elf
*.map

# Keep sdkconfig.defaults, idf_component.yml and dependencies.lock tracked.
# Do not blanket-ignore *.bin: vendor/radio firmware may be a source asset.
/migration/host_legacy/main/c6_image.bin

# WebGUI / Node.js / Vite / Vue / TypeScript / Vitest / Playwright
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/dist-ssr/
**/coverage/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
**/.vite/
*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Python tooling / tests
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/.tox/
**/.cache/

# Editor-machine state; shared VS Code tasks/settings/extensions are versioned
**/.vscode/*.local.json
**/.vscode/ipch/
**/.vscode/.browse.VC.db*
**/.idea/
*.iml

# OS / debugging / local temporary files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
*.log

